<title>USA: Momentum cuts Harken Energy stake.</title>
<headline>Momentum cuts Harken Energy stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Momentum Operating Co Inc said Tuesday it cuts its stake in Harken Energy Corp to 4,421,800 common shares or 4.87 percent of the outstanding from 5.7 percent held on July 18.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Momentum said it sold the shares on August 19.</p>
<p>The filing did not give the amount of shares sold or the price they went for. However, on July 18, Momentum's stake totalled 5.15 million common shares.</p>
</text>
